<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Air raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Air raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its rating for Tower Air Inc Thursday to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company rose 8/16 to 3-3/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
